OL,3,A'I paid thousands to a company for jobs
OL,4,Athat never came'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA company has been accused of promising
OL,7,Fjobs in the healthcare sector which
OL,8,Fnever materialised, leaving people
OL,9,Fthousands of pounds out of pocket.
OL,11,FRegistered in 2025, Synetal Solutions
OL,12,FLtd says it offers career-focused
OL,13,Ftraining programmes in the healthcare
OL,14,Fand IT sectors.
OL,16,FBut the BBC has spoken to a number of
OL,17,Fpeople who claim they were promised
OL,18,Ftraining and support to secure
OL,19,Fsponsored healthcare jobs that never
OL,20,Fbecame available to apply for.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
