OL,3,A'I paid thousands to a company for jobs
OL,4,Athat never came'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondon Citizens Advice says it has seen
OL,7,Fan increase in recruitment-related
OL,8,Fscams since the government stopped
OL,9,Foverseas recruitment for care workers.
OL,10,FThe charity described the firm's
OL,11,Fpractices as "unethical".
